    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire Univet Cannes Carnot, at 82-84 boulevard Carnot, is part of the Univet network and has a full technical platform: analysis lab, ultrasound, digital X-ray, scanner and a hospitalisation service with a separate kennel area. A solid address for your dog if you're staying around Cannes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Consultations are by appointment Monday to Saturday, from 9am to 12pm and 2pm to 7pm. The clinic's website states that it is open 24/7 for emergencies, for dogs, cats and exotic pets: in an emergency, call 04 93 99 33 39. The team has 6 vets and 7 assistants, and the clinic has private parking reserved for customers.</p>
      <div class="callout"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Emergencies: clinic open 24/7 (clinic website). Call before you come so they expect you.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Boulevard Carnot is in central Cannes, a few minutes' walk from the train station and the town centre.</p>
